6381848 1100 "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-x}+Bx{e}^{-x},\n$$\n\nsolve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+y=0,\\,y(0)=8,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=0.\n$$" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381848 1113 #uuid "08939a7c-c0f3-5976-a888-8e7f9abb04aa" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381848 1145 "We find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions. \n\n- Substituting $y(0)=8$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA=8.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=0,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-A{e}^{-x}+B{e}^{-x}-Bx{e}^{-x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=0$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n-A+B=0.\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that $A=8$ gives $B=8.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=8{e}^{-x}+8x{e}^{-x}.\n$$" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1000 #edb/ref 17592186381850 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1000 #edb/ref 17592186381851 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1000 #edb/ref 17592186381852 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1000 #edb/ref 17592186381853 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1000 #edb/ref 17592186381854 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1041 "selection" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1104 #edb/ref 17592186381853 13194139536064 true] [17592186381849 1110 #uuid "eb9f6266-adb6-510b-96d6-5c2926e352dc" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381850 1034 "y=8{e}^{-x}-4x{e}^{-x}" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381850 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536064 true] [17592186381850 1111 #uuid "f3427423-ce64-5e6e-8a38-831c684e2f35" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381851 1034 "y=8{e}^{-x}-8x{e}^{-x}" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381851 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536064 true] [17592186381851 1111 #uuid "8b7f6f36-998e-53bf-b5ba-b9a7938fda69" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381852 1034 "y=8{e}^{-x}+4x{e}^{-x}" 13194139536064 true] [17592186381852 1103